<section class="gasconv-section" id="gas-conversion">
  <div class="gasconv-inner">
    <div class="gasconv-panel">

      <div class="gasconv-header reveal">
        <div class="gasconv-eyebrow">OUR MOST TRUSTED SPECIALTY</div>
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">LPG <span class="accent">&amp;</span> CNG CONVERSION</h2>
        <p class="gasconv-intro">Gas conversion isn't a side service at Taqwa Automobile — it's what we do best. From the first inspection to the final road test, every LPG and CNG installation is handled by our specialist team, using certified kits and careful safety checks, with honest advice on what's right for your car and your budget.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gasconv-content">

        <div class="gasconv-steps">
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">01</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Free Consultation &amp; Inspection</h4>
              <p>We check your engine and fuel usage pattern to recommend LPG or CNG — whichever suits your car and budget best.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">02</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Right Kit Selection</h4>
              <p>Quality conversion kits matched to your engine size, so performance stays smooth after the switch.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">03</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Expert Installation</h4>
              <p>Our trained technicians fit the cylinder, injectors and wiring with precision and care.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">04</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Leak &amp; Pressure Testing</h4>
              <p>Every connection is pressure tested and leak checked before your car is cleared as safe to drive.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">05</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Tuning &amp; Road Test</h4>
              <p>We fine-tune the system for smooth performance, then take your car out for a real road test.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gs-item">
            <div class="gs-num">06</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Warranty &amp; After-Sales Care</h4>
              <p>2 year service warranty plus ongoing support — we're here whenever your car needs a check-up.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gasconv-compare">
          <div class="gc-card lpg">
            <div class="gc-icon"><svg class="icon" width="26" height="26"><use href="#icon-flame"/></svg></div>
            <h3>LPG Conversion</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Lower running cost than petrol</li>
              <li>Widely available refill stations</li>
              <li>Smooth, reliable engine performance</li>
              <li>Great fit for private &amp; light vehicles</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="gc-card cng">
            <div class="gc-icon"><svg class="icon" width="26" height="26"><use href="#icon-leaf"/></svg></div>
            <h3>CNG Conversion</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Among the lowest running costs on the road</li>
              <li>Cleaner burning, eco-friendly fuel</li>
              <li>Durable cylinder, long service life</li>
              <li>Ideal for daily, high-mileage driving</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="gasconv-actions">
        <a href="tel:+8801854226757" class="btn btn-red"><svg class="icon" width="15" height="15"><use href="#icon-phone"/></svg> Call For Free Consultation</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8801854226757" class="btn btn-green"><svg class="icon" width="15" height="15"><use href="#icon-whatsapp"/></svg> WhatsApp Us</a>
      </div>

